#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:85 crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:106
msgid "cannot read config, falling back to the built-in lean theme: "
msgstr "读取配置失败，回退内置 lean 主题: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:96
msgid ""
"unknown preset, falling back to the built-in lean theme (expected lean/"
"classic/rainbow/pure): "
msgstr "未知预设，回退内置 lean 主题（可选 lean/classic/rainbow/pure）: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:126
msgid "not inside a p11k session (P11K_ENGINE_PID is unset)"
msgstr "当前不在 p11k 会话中（P11K_ENGINE_PID 未设置）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:134
msgid ""
"this session has no theme file: it was started with --preset or the built-in "
"theme"
msgstr "本会话没有主题文件：启动时用的是 --preset 或内置主题"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:147
msgid "cannot signal the engine (the session may have exited)"
msgstr "无法向引擎发送信号（会话可能已退出）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:170
msgid ""
"unknown shell in the config, falling back to $SHELL (expected zsh/bash/fish/"
"pwsh): "
msgstr "配置里的 shell 无法识别，回退到 $SHELL（可选 zsh/bash/fish/pwsh）: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:202
msgid "usage: p11k [options]"
msgstr "用法: p11k [选项]"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:203
msgid "       p11k configure"
msgstr "       p11k configure"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:204
msgid "       p11k reload"
msgstr "       p11k reload"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:206
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "选项:"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:208
msgid ""
"  --shell <name>   inner shell to proxy: zsh, bash, fish or pwsh (default: "
"the `shell` config node, else $SHELL)"
msgstr ""
"  --shell <名字>   被代理的内部 shell：zsh、bash、fish 或 pwsh（缺省取配置里"
"的 `shell` 节点，无则用 $SHELL）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:211
msgid ""
"  --config <path>  KDL theme file (default: ~/.config/p11k/p11k.kdl, else "
"the built-in lean theme)"
msgstr ""
"  --config <路径>  KDL 主题文件（缺省 ~/.config/p11k/p11k.kdl，无则用内置 "
"lean 主题）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:213
msgid "  --preset <name>  built-in theme: lean, classic, rainbow or pure"
msgstr "  --preset <名字>  内置主题：lean、classic、rainbow 或 pure"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:214
msgid "  --version        print the version and exit"
msgstr "  --version        打印版本后退出"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:215
msgid "  --help           print this help and exit"
msgstr "  --help           打印本说明后退出"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:217
msgid "Commands:"
msgstr "子命令:"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:218
msgid "  configure        interactive theme wizard"
msgstr "  configure        交互式主题向导"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:219
msgid "  reload           re-read the theme file of the running session"
msgstr "  reload           重新读取当前会话的主题文件"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:221
msgid "Environment: P11K_ENGINE guards against recursion; P11K_USER_ZSHRC and"
msgstr "环境变量：P11K_ENGINE 用于防止递归加载；P11K_USER_ZSHRC 与"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:222
msgid "P11K_USER_PROFILE override the rc that gets sourced; P11K_LOCALEDIR"
msgstr "P11K_USER_PROFILE 用于覆盖所 source 的 rc；P11K_LOCALEDIR"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:223
msgid "overrides the translation directory. The engine exports P11K_CONFIG and"
msgstr "用于覆盖翻译目录。引擎会把 P11K_CONFIG 与"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:224
msgid "P11K_ENGINE_PID into the shell for `p11k reload`."
msgstr "P11K_ENGINE_PID 导出给 shell，供 `p11k reload` 使用。"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/cli.rs:226
msgid ""
"To use p11k as your theme, add one line to your shell rc — see README.md."
msgstr "若要将 p11k 用作主题，请在 shell rc 中加入一行，详见 README.zh.md"

